OL,3,ACaptain in custody after boat capsizes
OL,4,Aoff northern Cyprus, local leader says,
OL,5,Aas eight reported dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeven people have died after a
OL,8,Fpassenger boat capsized near northern
OL,9,FCyprus
OL,11,FSearch and rescue operations are under
OL,12,Fway to find 23 people missing, says
OL,13,FUnal Ustel, prime minister of the
OL,14,Fself-declared Turkish Republic of
OL,15,FNorthern Cyprus
OL,17,FThe boat's captain and seven crew have
OL,18,Fbeen taken into custody, Ustel says
OL,20,FWhen the vessel capsized, there 267
OL,21,Fpeople were on board, he says, and 237
OL,22,Fhave been rescued
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
