OL,3,ACaptain in custody after boat capsizes
OL,4,Aoff northern Cyprus, local leader says,
OL,5,Aas eight reported dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe boat left from the northern Cypriot
OL,8,Fport of Kyrenia at 11:58 local time
OL,9,F(09:58 BST) and officials say it
OL,10,Fcapsized around four nautical miles
OL,11,Finto its journey to Turkey
